 "remarks": "Welcome to Applecrest, a private Greenwich estate offering an extraordinary blend of tranquility and convenience. Set behind gates on 28+ picturesque acres, this recently updated 5,404+ SF residence offers 5 bedrooms and 6.5 baths. Expansive windows and French doors frame breathtaking views of the grounds, while a gourmet kitchen opens to an impressive family room with vaulted ceilings. A luxurious primary suite is complemented by four generously proportioned ensuite bedrooms. Rolling lawns, a pool, pool house, gazebo, private lake and waterfall create an idyllic retreat just minutes from Glenville and Greenwich Avenue, and approximately one hour from NYC. Available December 18. Not to be missed!",
